{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 94432, "game_id": 1164, "entry_id": 66708, "uid": 82806, "type": 4, "title": "水人偶选择攻略（PVE）", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1639655486, "updated_at": 1639891917, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1639891917, "last_at": 1657204577, "comment_count": 0, "status": 1, "summary": "※标红的为增伤、加速、减防人偶，对伤害有比较明显提升※标紫色的为队长技增强人偶，这类人偶技能大部分都跟原有队长技不冲突※黑色为加盾、回血、吸血、追伤等人偶，对伤害提升不明显1.橙色嫦娥，DS给予我方3", "thumb": "", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 1, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 5150, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 0, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 94432, "content": "<div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">※标红的为增伤、加速、减防人偶，对伤害有比较明显提升</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background: transparent;\">※</span>标紫色的为队长技增强人偶，这类人偶技能大部分都跟原有队长技不冲突</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">※黑</span>色为加盾、回血、吸血、追伤等人偶，对伤害提升不明显</div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639655528570_12740702.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639655528570_12740702.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\" alt=\"水人偶选择攻略（PVE）\"></div><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">1.橙色嫦娥，DS给予我方3体45%几率重置技能转圈，自身DS条+25%，队长技给予我方全体技能充能量+10%，总体来说挺不错的，PVEPVP都有用，PVE主要作用是队长技和+DS条快速进FT，RDRB里给水丹丹比较合适进一步增强队长增强DS，给桂花基本上只能吃个队长技增益因为桂花一般不打DS，WB里给菩萨替换火妈队长技（待测试效果）</span><div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639662049026_51427435.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639662049026_51427435.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\" alt=\"水人偶选择攻略（PVE）\"></div>2.橙色伊芙，NS火属性敌人追加300伤害，SSHP剩余最少敌方3体1000固定追加伤害，DS敌方4回合中毒，偏PVP向人偶，水系五星只有鲤鱼适合打PVP，给他应该是最好的</div><div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639662332905_34223247.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639662332905_34223247.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\" alt=\"水人偶选择攻略（PVE）\"></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\">3.紫色巴里，NS75%几率给予敌方禁疗，SSdebuff中的2名敌人20秒内烙印（每4秒造成（对象buff数+1）×70的持续伤害，最大buff数6个（最终7个），偏PVP向天子，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">水系五星只有鲤鱼适合打PVP，给他应该是最好的</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639662515864_69662465.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639662515864_69662465.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\" alt=\"水人偶选择攻略（PVE）\"></div><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">4.紫色丑人鱼，NS攻击力最高我方2体10秒内技能充能速度+40%，SS75%几率给予我方水属性3体2回合内SS技能-1秒，NS充能速度跟伪娘技能重复，用处不大，主要是SS技能的水属性3体-1秒CD，RDRB里给水丹丹增加全队回转</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639662755578_92242328.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639662755578_92242328.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\" alt=\"水人偶选择攻略（PVE）\"></div>5.SS给予HP剩余最少我方2体12秒内130HP持续回血，DS给予我方HP剩余最少2体16秒内不死，RDRB里给水丹丹或者阿罗汉增加全队生存，WB里给<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;text-align:left;\">阿罗汉增加全队生存</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;text-align:left;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639662936394_7276220.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639662936394_7276220.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\" alt=\"水人偶选择攻略（PVE）\"></div>6.紫色老头，NS给予攻击最高敌方2体3回合中毒（每次400），队长技给予水属性我方DS攻击力+7.5%，各方面都不是很突出的人偶，给桂花增加点中毒伤害也可以</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;text-align:left;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639663077067_64619891.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639663077067_64619891.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\" alt=\"水人偶选择攻略（PVE）\"></div>7.紫色水炮，NS给予自身300HP吸收，SS给予我方全体16秒内盾+1300，WB向人偶，给阿罗汉增加全队生存，RDRB也给阿罗汉增加全队生存</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;text-align:left;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639663200274_16413854.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639663200274_16413854.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\" alt=\"水人偶选择攻略（PVE）\"></div>8.蓝色轮胎，NS给予火属性敌方225追加伤害，RDRB里给桂花<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;text-align:left;\">或者其他刀</span>稍微增加点FT伤害</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;text-align:left;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639663287793_24875608.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639663287793_24875608.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\" alt=\"水人偶选择攻略（PVE）\"></div>9.蓝色扑克，NS给予HP剩余最少我方1体325即使回血，RDRB里给伪娘增加全队生存，WB用处不大</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;text-align:left;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639663399653_95724720.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639663399653_95724720.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\" alt=\"水人偶选择攻略（PVE）\"></div>10.蓝色泳圈，SS敌方3回合内中毒（每次350伤害），RDRB里给主打S天子稍微增加点伤害</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;text-align:left;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639663537757_89536649.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639663537757_89536649.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\" alt=\"水人偶选择攻略（PVE）\"></div>11.蓝色提琴，NS给予敌方3回合中毒（每次350伤害）<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;text-align:left;\">，RDRB里给主打N天子稍微增加点伤害</span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;text-align:left;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639663617896_66090227.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639663617896_66090227.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\" alt=\"水人偶选择攻略（PVE）\"></div>12.蓝色翻车鱼，SS给予水属性我方2体16秒内技能充能速度+37.5%，冲突的妈都不认识了，PVE没用，PVP看情况搭配</span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;text-align:left;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639663686760_99505901.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639663686760_99505901.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\" alt=\"水人偶选择攻略（PVE）\"></div><br></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;text-align:left;\">13.蓝色伪娘，SS给予攻击力最高我方1体技能充能量+32.5%，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;text-align:left;\">冲突的妈都不认识了，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;text-align:left;\">PVE没用，PVP看情况搭配</span></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639663868668_12822387.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639663868668_12822387.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\" alt=\"水人偶选择攻略（PVE）\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">14.绿色马尾，NS给予敌方200追加伤害，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;text-align:left;\">，RDRB里给桂花或者其他刀稍微增加点FT伤害</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639663868670_44995562.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639663868670_44995562.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\" alt=\"水人偶选择攻略（PVE）\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">15.绿色魔童，NS给予敌方1体3回合中毒（每次300伤害）<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;text-align:left;\">，RDRB里给主打N天子稍微增加点伤害</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639663868670_52061496.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639663868670_52061496.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\" alt=\"水人偶选择攻略（PVE）\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\">16.绿色护士，SS给予DEBUFF中我方1体12秒内110HP持续回血，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;text-align:left;\">RDRB里给主打S天子（水丹丹、阿罗汉）稍微增加生存</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639663868670_11935483.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639663868670_11935483.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\" alt=\"水人偶选择攻略（PVE）\"></div><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">17.绿色丽萨，SS给予我方全体16秒内SS攻击力+20%，RDRB向人偶，给主打S天子<span style=\"font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\">（水丹丹、阿罗汉）全面增伤，WB冲突用不到</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639664152932_13504732.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639664152932_13504732.png\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 165px;\" alt=\"水人偶选择攻略（PVE）\"></div><span style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div class=\"div-img\"></div>18.白色水胖，SS就自身16秒内盾+800，<span>RDRB向人偶，给你容易死的水天子装上增加生存</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:14px;text-align:left;\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><span style=\"color: rgb(75, 82, 91); text-align: center;\"></span></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": null, "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 82806, "username": "大花", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/23.png", "description": "", "follow_num": 24, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 1, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 1, "content_at": 114945282, "content_num": 85, "read_num": 465756, "like_num": 318}, "update_user": {"uid": 0, "username": "", "avatar": "", "description": "", "follow_num": 0, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 0, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 1164, "name": "天命之子日服", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1164/57/2022/0/26/583959.png", "alias": "dcj", "content_count": 1066, "follow_count": 708}, "themes": null, "seo_format": {"title": "", "desc": "", "key": ""}, "video_format": {"cover": "", "video": "", "width": "", "height": "", "duration": 0, "video_compressed": ""}, "contributor": null, "vote_list": null, "ban_image_list": null, "is_strategy": false, "is_strategy_v1": false, "entry_data_bind": null, "entry_data_bind_cdn": "", "emoji": [{"id": 6, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/332900.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id": 4, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/652839.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id": 3, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/36968.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id": 12, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/862842.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}], "reward": {"user_count": 0, "last_user_list": null}, "content_tj_eq": {"content_id": 0, "content": "", "version": ""}, "content_tj_lineup": {"content_id": 0, "content": "", "content_1": "", "version": ""}, "content_tj_eq_cdn": "", "content_tj_lineup_cdn": "", "content_live_2d": "", "hot_content_strategies": [{"id": 579099, "name": "仅限日服手机端与DMM端互通联动相关", "icon": "", "jump_url": ""}, {"id": 81030, "name": "提瓦兹", "icon": "", "jump_url": ""}, {"id": 84657, "name": "还魂优先级", "icon": "", "jump_url": ""}, {"id": 93040, "name": "星图困难攻略", "icon": "", "jump_url": ""}], "related_strategies": [{"id": 94542, "name": "暗人偶选择攻略（PVE）", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639891836891_2980500.png", "jump_url": ""}, {"id": 94228, "name": "火人偶选择攻略（PVE）", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639403245579_44660569.png", "jump_url": ""}, {"id": 94146, "name": "木人偶选择攻略（PVE）", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639292365976_26113884.png", "jump_url": ""}, {"id": 94147, "name": "光人偶选择攻略（PVE）", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1639292398216_7651693.png", "jump_url": ""}], "entry_pid": 110879}, "meta": {"request_id": "request:36dd2b66-73b4-4fce-b689-42e61fad4611", "trace_id": ""}}